  "description": "Bounded RegularCore-1-experimental, ECMAScript2025, XSD 1.1 (2012-04-05 Appendix G) regex and XPath/XQuery F&O 3.1 (2017-03-21 sections 5.6/C.1) named POSIX Issue 7/2018 C/POSIX byte BRE/ERE, PCRE2-10.46-ManagedStandard8_16-v1 and Oniguruma-6.9.10 (TextMate grammar syntax) interpreters for .NET 10 (also .NET 8 and .NET Standard 2.0), with span searches, reusable workspaces and typed host functions. ECMAScript and XML select Unicode 16.0.0 (default) or 17.0.0. XML uses strict UTF-16/UTF-8 and XML 1.0 Fifth Edition; ECMAScript is UTF-16-only; RegularCore also admits raw bytes.",
